  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For the reaction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8652;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>495</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>478</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>If we start the reaction in a closed container at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>495</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>22</mn></math> millimoles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>, the amount of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is the equilibrium mixture is ________ millimoles. (Round off to the Nearest Integer).</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>;</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "20",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;G</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>RT&#8467;nK</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub></math></p><p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;G</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>478</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>KJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mole</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>495</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>478</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>495</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><msub><mi>nK</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#8467;</mi><msub><mi>nK</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8652;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>22</mn></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>22</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p>So&nbsp;millimoles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p>",
